                                                "sense_id": "2c7f1cf4-e50e-337f-9447-ce015da1468c",
                                                "text": "While commentators deplored the thuggery of some cabdrivers, they deplored “L’uberisation” even more. “The uberisation of the economy is a godless and lawless development model,” wrote Jean-Michel Bouguereau in La République des Pyrénées."
